module jev_provenance_change_review

input provenance_change_proposal
input reviewer_digest
input approval_evidence_digest
input application_boundary_digest

status UNKNOWN proposal identity is not bound
status PENDING review or approval evidence is incomplete
status ACCEPTED_FOR_APPLICATION proposal may enter a separate explicit application step
status REJECTED proposal cannot cross the declared boundary

field status
field proposal_digest
field reviewer_digest
field approval_evidence_digest
field application_boundary_digest
field first_boundary
field reason
field application_allowed
field review_digest

constraint proposal_precedes_review
constraint approval_evidence_is_explicit
constraint application_is_separate
constraint accepted_is_not_applied
constraint no_automatic_authorization
constraint no_provider_invocation
